  "source": "customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1, 2026-11-06: role XML diff of the published 1.2.4.0 (a4b6459da3) to the 1.3.0.0 source. Cumulative: carries every 1.2.4.0 expectation (still true in the 1.3.0.0 source), because a stamp on 1.2.3.1 (ACME) upgrades straight to 1.3.0.0. New in 1.3.0.0: sprk_InvoiceLineItem is removed from the package (ebilling-r1 task 029), so its privileges leave Basic User, Core User and Ontology Service; Basic and Core User lose Read on sprk_ExternalServiceConfig and read AI/grid configuration at Global (#2474); the eBilling tables (#2591, ebilling-r1) are added to Basic, Core and Office Add In User; the new role Spaarke Billing Administrator (ebilling-r1 task 120, EB-D-162). Task 046c of field-mapping-server-write-path-r1 (owner ruling 2026-11-06): Spaarke Basic User is read-only on Spaarke tables, so the 80 privileges of removals gap R3 (config/feature-role-privileges.json) are absent on it; Spaarke Core User gains the three reference-table AppendTo privileges of gap G17.",
